WEBVTT

00:22:57.904 --> 00:23:00.861
CA: Bryan, you've struck
a massive chord here.

00:23:00.885 --> 00:23:02.306
You're an inspiring person.

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:04.540
Thank you so much
for coming to TED. Thank you.

00:23:04.564 --> 00:23:11.564
(Applause and cheers)

00:23:14.523 --> 00:23:16.262
BS: Thank you. Thank you.

00:23:16.286 --> 00:23:19.960
(Applause and cheers)